WEBVTT

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.894
remarkable things happen.

00:05:01.894 --> 00:05:05.013
I was flying on a trip,

00:05:05.013 --> 00:05:07.128
and I was witness to an incident

00:05:07.128 --> 00:05:09.016
where a passenger attempted to board

00:05:09.016 --> 00:05:12.627
before their number was called,

00:05:12.627 --> 00:05:15.196
and I watched the gate agent

00:05:15.196 --> 00:05:17.620
treat this man like he had broken the law,

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.029
like a criminal.

00:05:19.029 --> 00:05:20.875
He was yelled at for attempting to board

00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:23.246
one group too soon.

00:05:23.246 --> 00:05:24.690
So I said something.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.360
I said, "Why do you have treat us like cattle?

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:30.451
Why can't you treat us like human beings?"